    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. one thing that's tripping me up is the baggage situation for these transits. if we have to reclaim bags and re-check them for a connecting flight in a hub like singapore or bangkok, does that automatically count as \"entering\" the country and requiring a full visa even if we don't leave the airport? i just want to make sure we dont have any issues with the officers at the gate if we have to clear customs for the luggage.",
